    DIVINE @ talk "{i}은밀한 관계?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:104
translate kr qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_46740ede:

    # "Suddenly realizing what Mika was asking for, Sister Divine panicked as she offered sheepish protest."
    "미카가 무엇을 요구하는지 갑자기 깨달은 자매 디바인은 당황하며 머뭇거리며 항의했다."

