    # DIVINE @ sad "But grown women still have needs ... So we find what we can of it amongst ourselves."
    DIVINE @ sad "하지만 어른 여자들에게도 욕구는 있죠... 그래서 우리끼리 할 수 있는 걸 찾아요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:114
translate kr qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_10285b36:

    # MC @ talk "You don't need to explain yourself to me, sister."
    MC @ talk "저에게 변명하실 필요 없어요, 자매님."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:115
translate kr qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_4014a5dc:

    # MC @ talk "I only mentioned it because Mika has asked me to persuade you to give her the same affection as you give the others."
    MC @ talk "미카가 당신이 다른 이들에게 주는 것과 같은 애정을 자신에게도 달라고 설득해달라고 해서 말씀드린 것뿐입니다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:116
translate kr qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_c7f64210:

